Package: imageTCGAutils
Title: Utility functions for working with histopatholgy images
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu",
    c("aut", "cre"), c(ORCID = "")),
    person("Ilaria", "Billato", role = c("aut", "ctb")),
    person("Eslam", "Ambrousamra", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Utility functions for working with CONCH data, listing remote
    files. One function assigns HoverNet nuclei to ProvGigaPath tiles with
    a scale factor to align coordinates. The funcitions in this package
    are not meant for end users.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6.0)
